; Structure: E8 01 00  CB   = call near_next; retf
; The call lands on the instruction IMMEDIATELY AFTER the retf - i.e. the
; real (near) routine that follows in the segment.  Makes a near function
; far-callable: caller far-calls the stub, stub near-calls the body, body
; returns near, stub returns far.  Generated by RTLink for cross-segment
